  - characterName: 
    expressionName: 
    dialogueEN: A TROPICAL CYCLONE HAS BEGUN TO STRIKE <b>ALDINA DISTRICT</b>
    dialogueID: SIKLON TROPIS MULAI MELANDA KECAMATAN ALDINA
  - characterName: 
    expressionName: 
    dialogueEN: THE STORM IS EXPECTED TO LAST A LONG TIME. <b>PLEASE BE CARREFUL</b>
    dialogueID: BADAI DIPERKIRAKAN AKAN BERLANGSUNG LAMA. <b>BERHATI-HATILAH</b>
  - characterName: 
    expressionName: 
    dialogueEN: AVOID STORM-PRRONE AREAS. <b>SAVE YOURSELF</b>
    dialogueID: HINDARI DAERAH YANG RAWAN DENGAN BADAI. <b>SELAMATKAN DIRI ANDA</b>
